JIRAYIA – AI-Powered Autonomous Healthcare Assistant
<div align="center">
Revolutionizing Hospital Care Through Robotics, AI, and Intelligent Automation

An AI-integrated robotic assistant designed to support healthcare professionals by automating routine hospital tasks, improving patient care, and reducing staff workload.

</div>
📌 Overview

JIRAYIA is a smart healthcare robotic assistant developed to address challenges faced by modern hospitals, including staff shortages, patient overcrowding, delayed monitoring, and repetitive manual tasks. The system combines Artificial Intelligence (AI), Machine Learning (ML), IoT sensors, and Cyber-Physical Systems to create an autonomous robot capable of assisting healthcare workers in real-time.

Designed using Arduino, Mixly, Bluetooth communication, and sensor-based navigation, JIRAYIA can perform essential tasks such as:

🌡️ Contactless patient temperature monitoring
🚑 Autonomous hospital navigation
💊 Medicine and document delivery
🚧 Obstacle detection and avoidance
📊 Real-time patient data logging
📱 Manual control via mobile application

The goal of JIRAYIA is not to replace healthcare professionals but to augment their capabilities, allowing them to focus on critical patient care while the robot handles repetitive operational tasks.

🎯 Problem Statement

Healthcare facilities worldwide face increasing pressure due to:

Shortage of doctors and nursing staff
High patient-to-caregiver ratio
Delayed patient monitoring
Increased risk of infection during physical interactions
Staff burnout due to repetitive non-clinical activities

According to WHO reports, healthcare worker shortages remain a major challenge in developing nations. Routine tasks consume significant time that could otherwise be spent on critical patient care.

JIRAYIA aims to bridge this gap through intelligent automation.

💡 Proposed Solution

JIRAYIA is an autonomous robotic platform capable of:

Navigating hospital corridors using line-following technology.
Detecting and avoiding obstacles in real time.
Monitoring patient temperature using contactless sensors.
Making intelligent decisions using AI/ML algorithms.
Logging data to cloud platforms for monitoring and analysis.
Operating in both autonomous and manual modes.
🚀 Key Features
🌡️ Contactless Health Monitoring
MLX90614 Infrared Temperature Sensor
Accurate non-contact temperature measurement
Reduces infection transmission risks
🚧 Obstacle Avoidance
Ultrasonic sensor-based detection
Real-time collision prevention
Safe hospital navigation
🛣️ Autonomous Navigation
IR-based line-following system
Hospital route tracking
Efficient movement between wards
📱 Bluetooth Manual Control
Mobile application interface
Manual override functionality
Emergency control capability
🧠 AI-Powered Decision Making
Random Forest Algorithm
Lightweight Neural Network (MLP)
Context-aware task prediction
☁️ Cloud Integration
Firebase database integration
Real-time data storage
Remote monitoring capabilities
🤖 AI & Machine Learning Integration

JIRAYIA incorporates intelligent decision-making using:

Random Forest Classifier

Used for:

Task prioritization
Patient monitoring decisions
