⚙️ Hardware Components
Component	Purpose
Arduino Uno R3	Main Controller
MLX90614 Sensor	Contactless Temperature Monitoring
Ultrasonic Sensor	Obstacle Detection
IR Sensors	Line Following
Bluetooth Module HC-05	Wireless Control
L293D Motor Driver	Motor Control
BO Motors	Robot Mobility
Robotic Arm	Lightweight Item Handling
Li-ion Battery	Portable Power Supply
